    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d957">

                <pb facs="0978" n="866" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg866"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 23905/3A.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Taft to the President of
                    Venezuela.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >The White House</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-04-19"><hi rendition="#italic">April 19,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>On this centennial anniversary of the independence of the Republic of Venezuela I
                    have the honor to convey to your excellency and to <pb facs="0979" n="867"
                        xml:id="pg867"/> the Government and people of Venezuela the congratulations
                    and good wishes of the Government and people of the United States of America and
                    my own personal best wishes for the continued success of your
                    administration.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wm. H. Taft.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
